From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cloud-media-center-engine <engine@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rename package identity from com.dot.gallery to
 com.diegonmarcos.mediacenter

Minimal first patch: gives the fork its own applicationId + content-
provider authority, separate from upstream ReFra (com.dot.gallery).
Required for the engine's identity-assert (build.json::forks.<key>
.app_id) to pass at all — GHA runs up to 30540989541 built and signed
a real APK, then correctly refused to publish it because its package
was still com.dot.gallery.

Three lines, all release-buildType, all the same underlying identity:
  - defaultConfig.applicationId
  - release buildType's "appProvider" manifestPlaceholder
  - release buildType's CONTENT_AUTHORITY BuildConfig field
The latter two matter beyond the assert: an unchanged provider
authority would collide with upstream's own com.dot.gallery Gallery
app if both are ever installed on the same device (Android rejects
installing two apps that export the same provider authority).

No feature code touched. This ships a package-correctly-identified
local gallery only — PhotoPrism cloud source, NewPipe YouTube source,
and the profile picker are still unwritten (PLAN_cloud-media-center.md
step 5). Do not read this patch as feature-complete.
---
--- a/app/build.gradle.kts
+++ b/app/build.gradle.kts
@@ -84,7 +84,7 @@
     ndkVersion = "29.0.14033849"
 
     defaultConfig {
-        applicationId = "com.dot.gallery"
+        applicationId = "com.diegonmarcos.mediacenter"
         minSdk = 29
         targetSdk = 37
         versionCode = 51101
@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@
         }
         getByName("release") {
             manifestPlaceholders += mapOf(
-                "appProvider" to "com.dot.gallery.media_provider"
+                "appProvider" to "com.diegonmarcos.mediacenter.media_provider"
             )
             isMinifyEnabled = true
             isShrinkResources = true
@@ -168,7 +168,7 @@
             buildConfigField("Boolean", "WEBDAV_ENABLED", "$includeWebdav")
             buildConfigField("Boolean", "SMB_ENABLED", "$includeSmb")
             buildConfigField("Boolean", "NFS_ENABLED", "$includeNfs")
-            buildConfigField("String", "CONTENT_AUTHORITY", "\"com.dot.gallery.media_provider\"")
+            buildConfigField("String", "CONTENT_AUTHORITY", "\"com.diegonmarcos.mediacenter.media_provider\"")
             buildConfigField("Boolean", "ENABLE_INDEXING", "true")
             buildConfigField("Boolean", "ALLOW_INSECURE_TLS", "true")
         }

